韩的事。秦王召回甘茂，打算撤兵。甘茂说：“息壤还在那里。”秦王说：“有这回事。”于是大举起兵援助甘茂，斩杀韩军六万人，终于攻克宜阳。韩国国相公仲侈来到秦国谢罪求和。","content_jianti_auto":"1甘茂攻宜阳，五月而不拔。樗里子、公孙奭果争之。秦王召甘茂，欲罢兵。甘茂曰：「息壤在彼。」王曰：「有之。」因大悉起兵以佐甘茂，斩首六万，遂拔宜阳。韩公仲侈入谢于秦以请平。","dtjl_paragraph_links":[],"dtjl_references":[],"id":266,"number":1,"reading_annotation_sources":[],"start_index":0,"tongjian_id":"8c785908-db0e-11ef-bd7a-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_companion_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_decisions":[],"ExtRef_Children_hu_notes":[{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"people_name":"烏","people_name_jianti_auto":"乌","start_index":0,"tongjian_id":"8c78591c-db0e-11ef-bf4e-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"烏枝鳴","people_name_jianti_auto":"乌枝鸣","start_index":13,"tongjian_id":"8c78591d-db0e-11ef-b9f3-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"孟姓","people_name_jianti_auto":"孟姓","start_index":20,"tongjian_id":"8c78591e-db0e-11ef-8360-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"魯桓公","people_name_jianti_auto":"鲁桓公","start_index":23,"tongjian_id":"8c78591f-db0e-11ef-a944-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"仲孫","people_name_jianti_auto":"仲孙","start_index":28,"tongjian_id":"8c785920-db0e-11ef-8c68-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"仲孫","people_name_jianti_auto":"仲孙","start_index":33,"tongjian_id":"8c785921-db0e-11ef-995c-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"三桓","people_name_jianti_auto":"三桓","start_index":36,"tongjian_id":"8c785922-db0e-11ef-ae14-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"孟氏","people_name_jianti_auto":"孟氏","start_index":43,"tongjian_id":"8c785923-db0e-11ef-8c25-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"春秋","place_name_jianti_auto":"春秋","start_index":5,"tongjian_id":"8c785924-db0e-11ef-81ad-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"齊","place_name_jianti_auto":"齐","start_index":9,"tongjian_id":"8c785925-db0e-11ef-a17f-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"烏，姓也。春秋時，齊有大夫烏枝鳴。姓譜：孟姓，魯桓公之子仲孫之胤，仲孫爲三桓之孟，故曰孟氏。任，音壬。說，讀曰悅。","note_content_jianti_auto":"乌，姓也。春秋时，齐有大夫乌枝鸣。姓谱：孟姓，鲁桓公之子仲孙之胤，仲孙为三桓之孟，故曰孟氏。任，音壬。说，读曰悦。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":24,"tongjian_id":"8c78591b-db0e-11ef-b5cc-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"people_name":"武王","people_name_jianti_auto":"武王","start_index":49,"tongjian_id":"8c785928-db0e-11ef-a08d-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"周","place_name_jianti_auto":"周","start_index":52,"tongjian_id":"8c785929-db0e-11ef-8d3f-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"周","place_name_jianti_auto":"周","start_index":56,"tongjian_id":"8c78592a-db0e-11ef-95ea-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"脈，莫獲翻。脈者，係絡臟腑，其血理分行於支體之間，人舉重而力不能勝，故脈絕而死。按史記·甘茂傳云：武王至周而卒于周。蓋舉鼎者，舉九鼎也。世家以爲龍文赤鼎。史記「脈」作「臏」。","note_content_jianti_auto":"脉，莫获翻。脉者，系络脏腑，其血理分行于支体之间，人举重而力不能胜，故脉绝而死。按史记·甘茂传云：武王至周而卒于周。盖举鼎者，举九鼎也。世家以为龙文赤鼎。史记「脉」作「膑」。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":39,"tongjian_id":"8c785927-db0e-11ef-8956-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"族者，誅夷其族。","note_content_jianti_auto":"族者，诛夷其族。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":43,"tongjian_id":"8c78592e-db0e-11ef-a3d9-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"逆，迎也。","note_content_jianti_auto":"逆，迎也。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":64,"tongjian_id":"8c785930-db0e-11ef-81aa-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"people_name":"羋"