urce_name":"读史方舆纪要"}],"class_tags":["军事","内政"],"content":"3趙武靈王北略中山之地，至房子，遂至代，北至無窮，西至河，登黃華之上。與肥義謀胡服騎射以敎百姓，曰：「愚者所笑，賢者察焉。雖驅世以笑我，胡地、中山，吾必有之！」遂胡服。","content_fanyi":"赵武灵王向北略取中山国的土地，到达房子城，接着抵达代郡，再向北到达无穷门一带，又向西到黄河，登上黄河岸边的黄华山。他与大臣肥义商议穿胡人服装、练习骑马射箭，以教化百姓，说：“愚蠢的人所嘲笑的事情，贤明的人却能明察。即使驱使天下人都来嘲笑我，胡人的土地和中山国，我也一定要占有它们！”于是改穿胡服。","content_jianti_auto":"3赵武灵王北略中山之地，至房子，遂至代，北至无穷，西至河，登黄华之上。与肥义谋胡服骑射以教百姓，曰：「愚者所笑，贤者察焉。虽驱世以笑我，胡地、中山，吾必有之！」遂胡服。","dtjl_paragraph_links":[],"dtjl_references":[],"id":268,"number":3,"reading_annotation_sources":[],"start_index":2,"tongjian_id":"8c785945-db0e-11ef-b673-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_companion_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_decisions":[],"ExtRef_Children_hu_notes":[{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"親，謂父母。","note_content_jianti_auto":"亲，谓父母。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":27,"tongjian_id":"8c7a8f94-db0e-11ef-a371-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"people_name":"章","people_name_jianti_auto":"章","start_index":1,"tongjian_id":"8c7a8f97-db0e-11ef-9167-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"孔","people_name_jianti_auto":"孔","start_index":22,"tongjian_id":"8c7a8f98-db0e-11ef-bf72-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"張","people_name_jianti_auto":"张","start_index":26,"tongjian_id":"8c7a8f99-db0e-11ef-805a-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"退齋","people_name_jianti_auto":"退斋","start_index":30,"tongjian_id":"8c7a8f9a-db0e-11ef-9037-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"note_content":"『章：十二行本「己」作「之」；乙十一行本同；孔本同；張校同，退齋校同。』","note_content_jianti_auto":"『章：十二行本「己」作「之」；乙十一行本同；孔本同；张校同，退斋校同。』","note_type":"『章：[^』]*』","start_index":0,"tongjian_id":"8c7a8f96-db0e-11ef-89fa-a0d3651f611f"}],"note_content":"","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":51,"tongjian_id":"8c7a8f95-db0e-11ef-af94-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"德欲其下及，故先論於賤；卑賤者感其德，則德廣所及可知矣。法行自貴近始，故先信於貴；貴近者奉法，則法之必行可知矣。","note_content_jianti_auto":"德欲其下及，故先论于贱；卑贱者感其德，则德广所及可知矣。法行自贵近始，故先信于贵；贵近者奉法，则法之必行可知矣。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":88,"tongjian_id":"8c7a8f9c-db0e-11ef-9efd-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"則，法也。舍，讀曰捨。襲，重衣也。","note_content_jianti_auto":"则，法也。舍，读曰舍。袭，重衣也。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":161,"tongjian_id":"8c7a8f9e-db0e-11ef-a736-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"people_name":"章","people_name_jianti_auto":"章","start_index":1,"tongjian_id":"8c7a8fa1-db0e-11ef-b0a0-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"孔","people_name_jianti_auto":"孔","start_index":20,"tongjian_id":"8c7a8fa2-db0e-11ef-9a96-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"note_content":"『章：十二行本正作「熟」；乙十一行本同；孔本同。』","note_content_jianti_auto":"『章：十二行本正作「熟」；乙十一行本同；孔本同。』","note_type":"『章：[^』]*』","start_index":8,"tongjian_id":"8c7a8fa0-db0e-11ef-9c6c-a0d3651f611f"}],"note_content":"孰，古熟字，通。","note_content_jianti_auto":"孰，古熟字，通。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":180,"tongjian_id":"8c7a8f9f-db0e-11ef-98b9-a0